id: 26
hanzi: 池
pinyin: chí
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: pool; pond; cistern; reservoir; moat
  es: estanque; alberca; piscina; poza; foso

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | an enclosed body of still or bubbling water; pond; pool; basin | masa de agua delimitada natural o artificialmente; estanque; alberca; balsa | 泉水汇入池中 (the spring water flows into the pool)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 趵突泉清澈见底的泉池四周砌着整齐的青石栏杆，游人常倚栏俯瞰池中悠闲游动的锦鲤。 | Bàotūquán qīngchè jiàndǐ de quánchí sìzhōu qì zhe zhěngqí de qīngshí lángān, yóurén cháng yǐlán fǔkàn chí zhōng yōuxián yóudòng de jǐnlǐ. | Orderly bluestone balustrades enclose the crystal-clear pool of Baotu Spring, where visitors lean to watch swimming koi. | Barandillas de piedra azul rodean el límpido estanque del manantial Baotu, donde los visitantes se asoman a contemplar carpas que nadan.
  #2 | 该生态农业示范园区配套建设了多座生态储水池，用于收集雨水与净化农业回用水。 | Gāi shēngtài nóngyè shìfànyuán qū pèitào jiànshè le duō zuò shēngtài chǔshuǐchí, yòngyú shōují yǔshuǐ yǔ jìnghuà nóngyè huíyòngshuǐ. | The ecological agriculture demonstration park constructed multiple retention ponds to harvest rainwater and purify recycled agricultural runoff. | El parque agroecológico construyó varias balsas de almacenamiento para recolectar agua de lluvia y depurar caudales agrícolas reciclados.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
